{"seq":3,"slug":"finite-state-machines","title":"有限状态机设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/sequential-logic/finite-state-machines","wordCount":1500,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"有限状态机设计\">有限状态机设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>有限状态机（Finite State Machine, FSM）是时序逻辑设计的最高抽象层次，能够描述任何具有有限个状态和状态转换规则的数字系统行为。从协议解析到 CPU 控制器，从自动售货机到通信链路管理，FSM 是将复杂行为系统化表达和硬件化实现的标准方法论。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[FSM 分类] --&gt; B[Moore 型]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Mealy 型]&#10;    B --&gt; D[输出仅依赖当前状态]&#10;    C --&gt; E[输出依赖状态和输入]&#10;    D --&gt; F[输出与时钟同步]&#10;    E --&gt; G[输出响应更快]&#10;    F --&gt; H[无毛刺风险]&#10;    G --&gt; I[可能有毛刺]\">graph TD\n    A[FSM 分类] --&gt; B[Moore 型]\n    A --&gt; C[Mealy 型]\n    B --&gt; D[输出仅依赖当前状态]\n    C --&gt; E[输出依赖状态和输入]\n    D --&gt; F[输出与时钟同步]\n    E --&gt; G[输出响应更快]\n    F --&gt; H[无毛刺风险]\n    G --&gt; I[可能有毛刺]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Moore 型</th>\n<th>Mealy 型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输出依赖</td>\n<td>仅当前状态</td>\n<td>当前状态 + 当前输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出时刻</td>\n<td>进入状态时确定</td>\n<td>输入变化时可能变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态数量</td>\n<td>通常较多</td>\n<td>通常较少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出稳定性</td>\n<td>无组合逻辑毛刺</td>\n<td>可能有毛刺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应速度</td>\n<td>慢一个时钟周期</td>\n<td>同周期响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型应用</td>\n<td>安全关键控制</td>\n<td>高性能协议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fsm-设计流程\">FSM 设计流程</h2><h3 id=\"标准设计步骤\">标准设计步骤</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>行为描述</strong>：用文字或时序图描述系统行为</li>\n<li><strong>状态图绘制</strong>：确定状态集合和转换条件</li>\n<li><strong>状态编码</strong>：为每个状态分配二进制编码</li>\n<li><strong>激励方程推导</strong>：根据状态表确定触发器输入</li>\n<li><strong>输出方程推导</strong>：根据输出条件确定输出逻辑</li>\n<li><strong>电路实现</strong>：用触发器和组合逻辑实现</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[行为描述] --&gt; B[状态图]&#10;    B --&gt; C[状态表]&#10;    C --&gt; D[状态编码]&#10;    D --&gt; E[激励方程]&#10;    E --&gt; F[输出方程]&#10;    F --&gt; G[电路/HDL实现]&#10;    G --&gt; H[仿真验证]\">graph LR\n    A[行为描述] --&gt; B[状态图]\n    B --&gt; C[状态表]\n    C --&gt; D[状态编码]\n    D --&gt; E[激励方程]\n    E --&gt; F[输出方程]\n    F --&gt; G[电路/HDL实现]\n    G --&gt; H[仿真验证]</pre><h3 id=\"状态图规范\">状态图规范</h3><p>状态图由节点（状态）和有向边（转换）组成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>节点标注</strong>：状态名称 / 状态编码 / Moore 输出</li>\n<li><strong>边标注</strong>：转换条件 / Mealy 输出</li>\n<li><strong>初始状态</strong>：用箭头指示复位后的状态</li>\n<li><strong>完备性</strong>：每个状态对所有可能输入必须有明确的转换</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"moore-型-fsm\">Moore 型 FSM</h2><h3 id=\"结构模型\">结构模型</h3><p>Moore 机的输出完全由当前状态寄存器的值决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>次态</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>现态</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>输入</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{次态} = f(\\text{现态}, \\text{输入})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次态</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">现态</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输入</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p> </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>输出</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>现态</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{输出} = g(\\text{现态})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输出</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">现态</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"设计实例-序列检测器\">设计实例：序列检测器</h3><p>检测输入序列 &quot;101&quot;，检测到时输出 1（允许重叠）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S0</td>\n<td>初始/未匹配</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S1</td>\n<td>收到 &quot;1&quot;</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S2</td>\n<td>收到 &quot;10&quot;</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>收到 &quot;101&quot;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>状态转换：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现态</th>\n<th>输入=0</th>\n<th>输入=1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S0</td>\n<td>S0</td>\n<td>S1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S1</td>\n<td>S2</td>\n<td>S1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S2</td>\n<td>S0</td>\n<td>S3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>S2</td>\n<td>S1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; S0&#10;    S0 --&gt; S0: 0&#10;    S0 --&gt; S1: 1&#10;    S1 --&gt; S2: 0&#10;    S1 --&gt; S1: 1&#10;    S2 --&gt; S0: 0&#10;    S2 --&gt; S3: 1&#10;    S3 --&gt; S2: 0&#10;    S3 --&gt; S1: 1\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; S0\n    S0 --&gt; S0: 0\n    S0 --&gt; S1: 1\n    S1 --&gt; S2: 0\n    S1 --&gt; S1: 1\n    S2 --&gt; S0: 0\n    S2 --&gt; S3: 1\n    S3 --&gt; S2: 0\n    S3 --&gt; S1: 1</pre><h2 id=\"mealy-型-fsm\">Mealy 型 FSM</h2><h3 id=\"结构模型\">结构模型</h3><p>Mealy 机的输出由当前状态和当前输入共同决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>次态</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>现态</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>输入</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{次态} = f(\\text{现态}, \\text{输入})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次态</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">现态</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输入</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p> </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>输出</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>现态</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>输入</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{输出} = h(\\text{现态}, \\text{输入})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输出</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">现态</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输入</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"优势与风险\">优势与风险</h3><p>Mealy 机通常比等价的 Moore 机少一个状态（因为输出信息编码在转换边上），响应也快一个周期。但输出直接受输入影响，可能产生组合逻辑毛刺。工程实践中常在 Mealy 输出后加一级寄存器，兼得快速响应和稳定输出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态编码策略\">状态编码策略</h2><h3 id=\"编码方式对比\">编码方式对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码方式</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 状态位宽</th>\n<th>触发器数</th>\n<th>组合逻辑</th>\n<th>适用平台</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二进制编码</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil\\log_2 n\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最少</td>\n<td>较复杂</td>\n<td>ASIC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格雷码编码</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil\\log_2 n\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最少</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>跨时钟域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独热码 (One-Hot)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最多</td>\n<td>最简单</td>\n<td>FPGA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独冷码 (One-Cold)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最多</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>低有效逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"fpga-中的独热码优势\">FPGA 中的独热码优势</h3><p>FPGA 的查找表（LUT）输入有限（4~6 输入），独热码编码使得每个触发器的激励逻辑仅涉及少量状态位，完美匹配 LUT 结构：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>从状态</mtext><mi>j</mi><mtext>到状态</mtext><mi>i</mi><mtext>的转换条件</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i = \\sum_j (\\text{从状态} j \\text{到状态} i \\text{的转换条件} \\cdot Q_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">从状态</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">到状态</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的转换条件</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常只涉及 2~3 个状态位和少量输入信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态化简\">状态化简</h2><h3 id=\"等价状态\">等价状态</h3><p>两个状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等价的条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>对所有输入组合，输出相同</li>\n<li>对所有输入组合，次态等价</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"化简方法\">化简方法</h3><p><strong>隐含表法</strong>（Implication Table）：系统地检查所有状态对是否等价，合并等价状态减少触发器数量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>化简效果</th>\n<th>小型 FSM</th>\n<th>中型 FSM</th>\n<th>大型 FSM</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态减少比例</td>\n<td>0~30%</td>\n<td>10~40%</td>\n<td>5~20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发器节省</td>\n<td>可能减1位</td>\n<td>可能减1~2位</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要价值</td>\n<td>概念清晰</td>\n<td>资源优化</td>\n<td>验证简化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"安全-fsm-设计\">安全 FSM 设计</h2><h3 id=\"非法状态处理\">非法状态处理</h3><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 位状态寄存器有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种可能编码，但有效状态通常少于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。必须为非法状态定义行为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>方案 A</strong>：非法状态默认转到复位态（安全优先）</li>\n<li><strong>方案 B</strong>：无关项化简激励逻辑（面积优先）</li>\n<li><strong>方案 C</strong>：加看门狗检测非法状态并报警</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"亚稳态防护\">亚稳态防护</h3><p>异步输入进入 FSM 前必须经过同步器（2 级或 3 级 D 触发器级联），否则亚稳态可能导致状态机跑飞：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>同步级数</th>\n<th>MTBF（小时）</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 级</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ~ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>不推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 级</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ~ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>常规设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 级</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ~ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高可靠性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"hdl-中的-fsm-实现\">HDL 中的 FSM 实现</h2><h3 id=\"三段式编码风格\">三段式编码风格</h3><p>现代 RTL 设计中推荐的三段式 FSM 结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一段</td>\n<td>状态寄存器（时序逻辑）</td>\n<td>时钟边沿更新现态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二段</td>\n<td>次态逻辑（组合逻辑）</td>\n<td>根据现态和输入计算次态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三段</td>\n<td>输出逻辑（组合或时序）</td>\n<td>根据现态生成输出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三段式的优势：结构清晰，便于时序约束和综合优化，输出可选择寄存避免毛刺。</p>\n<h3 id=\"综合工具优化\">综合工具优化</h3><p>EDA 综合工具对 FSM 提供专门优化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自动状态编码选择（二进制 / 独热 / 格雷）</li>\n<li>不可达状态自动消除</li>\n<li>状态寄存器重定时（retiming）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>有限状态机是数字系统设计中描述控制逻辑的标准抽象工具。Moore 型适合输出稳定性要求高的场景，Mealy 型适合响应速度优先的场景。状态编码策略需要根据目标平台（FPGA vs ASIC）选择，独热码在 FPGA 中通常最优。安全设计需要处理非法状态和异步输入同步问题。掌握 FSM 的完整设计流程——从行为描述到状态图、从状态编码到 HDL 实现——是成为数字系统设计工程师的核心技能。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"有限状态机设计","id":"有限状态机设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"FSM 设计流程","id":"fsm-设计流程"},{"level":3,"text":"标准设计步骤","id":"标准设计步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"状态图规范","id":"状态图规范"},{"level":2,"text":"Moore 型 FSM","id":"moore-型-fsm"},{"level":3,"text":"结构模型","id":"结构模型"},{"level":3,"text":"设计实例：序列检测器","id":"设计实例-序列检测器"},{"level":2,"text":"Mealy 型 FSM","id":"mealy-型-fsm"},{"level":3,"text":"结构模型","id":"结构模型"},{"level":3,"text":"优势与风险","id":"优势与风险"},{"level":2,"text":"状态编码策略","id":"状态编码策略"},{"level":3,"text":"编码方式对比","id":"编码方式对比"},{"level":3,"text":"FPGA 中的独热码优势","id":"fpga-中的独热码优势"},{"level":2,"text":"状态化简","id":"状态化简"},{"level":3,"text":"等价状态","id":"等价状态"},{"level":3,"text":"化简方法","id":"化简方法"},{"level":2,"text":"安全 FSM 设计","id":"安全-fsm-设计"},{"level":3,"text":"非法状态处理","id":"非法状态处理"},{"level":3,"text":"亚稳态防护","id":"亚稳态防护"},{"level":2,"text":"HDL 中的 FSM 实现","id":"hdl-中的-fsm-实现"},{"level":3,"text":"三段式编码风格","id":"三段式编码风格"},{"level":3,"text":"综合工具优化","id":"综合工具优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"计数器与移位寄存器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/sequential-logic/counters-shift-registers"},"next":{"title":"时序分析与约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/digital-system-design/timing-analysis-constraints"}}